# Keep line endings LF everywhere.
#
# Git on Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite LF to
# CRLF on checkout and back on commit. The CI runners are Linux and the
# workflow files are shell/YAML, so normalize to LF in the repository
# itself. This keeps `git diff` clean across Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary
